; claude: BASIC -- the Tiny BASIC of 1976, Integer BASIC and Applesoft
; (plan_terminal.md, section 5): Basic_parse (a line read, by
; recursive descent), Basic_run (a program run, as a Talk conversation:
; INPUT a read whose continuation is the rest of the program),
; Basic_session (the prompt, editor and calculator in one, as in
; 1977), Basic_disk (the floppy of listings). Run by TinyBasic
; (apps/devtools/) and by TinyTerminal's shell as its command basic.
;
; Over libs/terminal's Talk, no Playground (libs/languages/README.md):
; the Teletype way is what puts it on a screen. A private library,
; installed as part of elm_playground.
